{
 "_comment": "The video shorts. tools/cut_shorts.py cuts video/<id>.mp4 from the recordings; tools/build.py lays out the carousel and the tutorial tiles. Times in segments are seconds in the source recording; every other time is seconds into the short. A cue shows its words (text) at t for d seconds, pointing at box ([x, y, w, h] as % of the screen); time it a second before the tap it names. glow: true also lights a soft glow round the box (off by default: the callout is enough). A tap draws a fingertip at at ([x, y] %) at t, pressing and rippling like iOS's Show Touches; with to and d it is a drag from at to to over d seconds. draft: true keeps a short off the published site (build with --drafts to see it).",
 "frame": "ipad",
